        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rQld4",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1339,
          "name": "H 7. 系统权限",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "7. 系统权限",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "H1ixWe",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1373,
          "name": "P 7. 系统权限",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "· 文件访问：仅通过系统文件选择器或拖放读取你指定的音频，以及向你选择的文件夹写入导出文件。\n· 网络：仅用于第 5 节所述的模型下载与更新检查。\n· 不请求麦克风、摄像头、位置、通讯录、照片或通知权限。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "C0Cbn",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1488,
          "name": "H 8. 追踪",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "8. 追踪",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dQvzk",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1522,
          "name": "P 8. 追踪",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "按照 Apple《App 跟踪透明度》的定义，本应用不进行追踪：不收集用于跨 App 或网站追踪的数据，不使用广告标识符，也不与数据经纪商共享数据。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "N6Wdb",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1612,
          "name": "H 9. 儿童",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "9. 儿童",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PO2J3",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1646,
          "name": "P 9. 儿童",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "应用不收集任何个人信息，因此不会有意收集 13 岁以下儿童（或所在司法辖区规定年龄以下未成年人）的数据；应用亦非专门面向儿童。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pcc7u",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1736,
          "name": "H 10. 你的权利",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "10. 你的权利",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oYvYZ",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1770,
          "name": "P 10. 你的权利",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "因为我们不持有你的任何个人数据，访问、更正、导出或删除请求可以由你直接在设备上完成（见第 6 节）。如你所在地区的法律（如 GDPR、CCPA）赋予你额外权利并希望向我们行使，请通过下方方式联系，我们会在 30 天内回复。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d3azwT",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1860,
          "name": "H 11. 网站 printemps.dev",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "11. 网站 printemps.dev",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "flLUJ",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1894,
          "name": "P 11. 网站 printemps.dev",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "本站是托管于 GitHub Pages 的静态页面：不设置追踪 Cookie，不加载第三方分析或广告脚本；仅从 GitHub 公开 API 读取最新版本以显示下载链接；语言偏好只保存在你浏览器的本地存储中。GitHub 作为托管方可能记录访问日志。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "iWwsV",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1984,
          "name": "H 12. 政策变更",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "12. 政策变更",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "JCsi2",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 2018,
          "name": "P 12. 政策变更",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "如本政策发生变更，我们会更新本页的生效日期，并在对应版本的发布说明中注明变更内容。重大变更会在应用的更新说明中提示。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
