          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "关于本政策或数据处理的任何问题，请通过 GitHub 仓库提交 Issue：github.com/Means88/printemps/issues。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
