        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xc6oG",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 160,
          "name": "Meta",
          "fill": "#8593A7",
          "content": "适用于 Printemps 0.1 · macOS、Windows、Linux · 更新于 2026 年 9 月 20 日",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FJx1X",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 220,
          "name": "H 1. 安装",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "1. 安装",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lunfr",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 254,
          "name": "P 1. 安装",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "macOS 14+（Apple 芯片）、Windows 10+（x64）、Linux x64。macOS：拖入应用程序；当前版本已签名未公证，首次在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性」点「仍要打开」。Windows：运行安装程序。Linux：chmod +x 后运行 AppImage。分离模型按需下载。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eMkGE",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 369,
          "name": "H 2. 首页与导入",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "2. 首页与导入",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oL820",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 403,
          "name": "P 2. 首页与导入",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "点「选择音频文件」或拖放音频；支持 WAV、FLAC、MP3、M4A、AIFF、OGG。每个项目只含一个音频文件，导入后直接进入工作台。首页列出最近项目，「全部项目」进入历史页。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Hg2gu",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 493,
          "name": "H 3. 工作台一览",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "3. 工作台一览",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "h4WqA",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 527,
          "name": "P 3. 工作台一览",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "顶栏：返回、项目名改名、分析、导出。工具栏：音轨列表、原始 / 分轨、时间显示格式、节拍器、分割、缩放。时间轴：节拍器轨、原始轨与各声部结果轨，刻度尺可点击或拖动定位。右侧剪辑详情；底部传输条。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fTaPw",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 617,
          "name": "H 4. 选择声部与分离",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "4. 选择声部与分离",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FC51D",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 651,
          "name": "P 4. 选择声部与分离",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "选中剪辑 → 「分离」；在弹窗中搜索或按分类勾选声部，摘要显示已缓存 / 待下载模型与处理设备。缺少的模型先下载再自动分离；进度显示在工作区，期间可继续试听。每个声部一条音轨，另有 Other 残差轨。结果剪辑可二次分离，来源保留。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "i87YGY",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 766,
          "name": "H 5. 试听",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "5. 试听",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "K47EtF",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 800,
          "name": "P 5. 试听",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "Space 播放 / 暂停，Home 回起点，←/→ 移动 1 秒（Shift 10 秒）。原始 / 分轨切换对比；每轨 S 独奏、M 静音、增益；总音量。I / O 设入出点，L 循环。+ / − 缩放，0 显示完整音频。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rtdnr",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 890,
          "name": "H 6. 剪辑编辑",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "6. 剪辑编辑",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "GRvDt",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 924,
          "name": "P 6. 剪辑编辑",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "点击选中；播放头处按 S 分割；拖动两端把手或在详情里输入源入点 / 出点精确裁剪；铅笔改名。选中片段后分离或导出只处理该范围，结果保持相同位置。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
