          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "7. 节奏与调性",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sdswo",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1048,
          "name": "P 7. 节奏与调性",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "顶栏「分析」本机估计 BPM、调性、拍号与第一拍；点击结果可手动修改或复位，不改变音频速度或音高。时间显示可切到「小节与拍」。节拍器随播放发声，可调音量，不占用键盘焦点。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "t17nXr",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1138,
          "name": "H 8. 音轨列表",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "8. 音轨列表",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eGXpI",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1172,
          "name": "P 8. 音轨列表",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "T 打开。拖动或上下按钮排序；显示 / 隐藏（只影响工作区与试听）；删除结果音轨（原始音轨不可删除）。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "L76aL",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1237,
          "name": "H 9. 导出",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "9. 导出",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "auYIk",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1271,
          "name": "P 9. 导出",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "生成独立 WAV（24 bit）或 FLAC 副本，私有结果不受影响。「导出剪辑」只导出所选剪辑；顶栏「导出」导出勾选的结果音轨（不含原始）。对齐：剪辑范围 / 项目时间轴（开头补空白）。完成后可打开文件夹。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eGuuQ",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1361,
          "name": "H 10. 项目管理",
          "fill": "#E8ECF2",
          "content": "10. 项目管理",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tik8F",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1395,
          "name": "P 10. 项目管理",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "「全部项目」搜索、筛选、排序；卡片可打开、改名、导出、删除。已删除项目可恢复，或勾选清理试听结果 / 永久清除。项目自动保存，失败时可重试保存。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
