          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "界面语言；处理设备：自动选择（显示实际设备）、CPU、NVIDIA CUDA、Apple MPS（实验性）；模型缓存目录与导出目录；检查并安装更新。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
