          "content": "14. 常见问题",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "L2herE",
          "x": 340,
          "y": 1891,
          "name": "P 14. 常见问题",
          "fill": "#A0AAB8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 760,
          "content": "macOS 无法打开 → 隐私与安全性放行；模型下载失败 → 重试下载，已完成部分保留；MPS 慢 → 改用 CPU；分离中断 → 重试；保存失败 → 重试保存；数据位置见隐私政策。",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
